### Create a basketball match (organizer: ana)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/matches?organizerId=3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateFrom": "2026-10-17T20:00:00",
  "dateTo": "2026-10-17T21:30:00",
  "sportId": 2,
  "venueId": 2
}

### All matches
GET http://localhost:8090/api/matches

### Volleyball
POST http://localhost:8090/api/sports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Volleyball", "numberOfPlayers": 12 }

